  41:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/../misc/lv_bidi_private.h **** /**
  42:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/../misc/lv_bidi_private.h ****  * Auto-detect the base direction of a text by scanning all strong characters.
  43:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/../misc/lv_bidi_private.h ****  * RTL takes priority: if any RTL strong character is found, `LV_BASE_DIR_RTL` is returned
  44:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/../misc/lv_bidi_private.h ****  * immediately. Otherwise, `LV_BASE_DIR_LTR` is returned if any LTR strong character is found.
